# Extended Server Actions

This section details specific server-side actions, often related to data manipulation through different storage modules, that can be triggered from the JSON UI.

## Action Categories

-   **[Directory Operations](./directory-operations.md)**: Actions for interacting with the filesystem directories (e.g., listing, creating).
-   **[Model Operations](./model-operations.md)**: Actions for CRUD operations on Eloquent models.
-   **[MySQL Operations](./mysql-operations.md)**: Actions for direct interaction with MySQL databases.
-   **[Session Operations](./session-operations.md)**: Actions for manipulating data stored in the user's session.

These documents likely detail the specific JSON structure required to invoke these backend operations. Refer to the `../commands-and-operations/` section for more general action concepts. 